 design</li> <li>Semi-fitted</li> </ul> </div> <div class=\"mt-8\"> Gildan 64000 t-shirts are part of our <a href=\"/products/unisex-apparel/\" title=\"Unisex apparel\">Unisex apparel</a> and <a href=\"/products/eco/\" title=\"Eco\">Eco</a> collections. </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"lg:w-3/5 pt-8 text-center\"> <ul class=\"product__gallery\"> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000/detail-02.webp\" alt=\"Detail 02\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000/detail-03.webp\" alt=\"Detail 03\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <img src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000/detail-01.webp\" alt=\"Detail 01\"/> </li> <li class=\"product__gallery-item\"> <video controls autoplay loop muted> <source src=\"/img/products/additional/gildan-64000/gildan64000-v9.webm\" type=\"video/webm\"> </video> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </section> <section id=\"product-range\" class=\"container\"> <div class=\" mt-16 pt-8 lg:mt-32 lg:pt-12 border-t\"> <h2 class=\" flex flex-col gap-2 mt-0 xl:pr-20 text-xl\"> Product range </h2> <div class=\" mt-8 lg:mt-0\"> <p class=\"lg:w-1/3 float-right lg:-mt-8 mb-8 lg:text-xs lg:text-right lg:text-gray-600\"> We offer the following Gildan 64000 t-shirts variants. <a href=\"https://dashboard.prodigi.com/login\" class=\"lg:whitespace-nowrap\" title=\"Sign up for an account\">Sign up for an account</a> for full details and pricing, and <strong>get 50% off your first sample order</strong>. </p> <h3 class=\"hidden\">Some example Gildan 64000 t-shirts</h3> <table class=\"table--stacked clear-both\"> <thead> <tr> <th></th> <th>SKU</th> <th>Ships from</th> <th></th> </tr> </thead> <tbody class=\"text-xs lg:text-sm text-gray-800 border-gray-100\"> <tr> <td>Unisex Softstyle T-shirt Gildan 64000</td> <td data-label=\"SKU\" class=\"whitespace-nowrap\">GLOBAL-TEE-GIL-64000</td> <td data-label=\"Ships from\" class=\"whitespace-nowrap\">UK, EU, US, AU, P