-impact dyes are free from chemicals and mordants.</p> </li> </ul> <div class=\"text-xs text-gray-600\"><p>Shipped in plastic-free packaging (excluding White).</p> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section id=\"packaging\" class=\"container\"> <div class=\"lg:flex mt-16 pt-8 lg:mt-32 lg:pt-12 border-t\"> <h2 class=\"lg:w-1/3 flex flex-col gap-2 mt-0 xl:pr-20 text-xl\"> Fulfilment &amp; packaging </h2> <div class=\"lg:w-2/3 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"> <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-12\"> <h3 class=\"hidden\">Fulfilment</h3> <div class=\"flex\"> <div class=\"lg:pr-12\"> <p>Gildan 64000 t-shirts are part of our <a href=\"/products/global/\" title=\"View our global range\">global print on demand range</a>. Order using a single SKU and we automatically fulfil your order from the print lab nearest to your customer.</p><p>Global products are greener, faster and cheaper.</p> </div> <a href=\"/products/global/\" class=\"w-56 mr-4 md:mr-8\" title=\"View our global range\"><svg version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" viewBox=\"0 0 453 453\" xml:space=\"preserve\"> <title>Global product stamp</title> <g> <g> <path style=\"fill:currentColor\" d=\"M424,226c0,110.73-89.77,200.5-200.5,200.5S23,336.73,23,226S112.77,25.5,223.5,25.5S424,115.27,424,226\"/> <path style=\"fill:#FFFFFF;\" d=\"M130.6,150.05c-3.31,4.29-7.12,7.46-11.41,9.52c-4.29,2.06-8.77,2.82-13.44,2.28 c-4.67-0.54-9.13-2.45-13.4-5.73c-4.19-3.22-7.2-7.01-9.04-11.37c-1.83-4.36-2.35-9-1.54-13.91c0.8-4.91,2.97-9.66,6.51-14.24 c1.94-2.51,4.14-4.76,6.6-6.74c2.46-1.99,5.01-3.59,7.64-4.82l5.13,5.77c-2.55,1.11-4.99,2.62-7.31,4.5 c-2.33,1.89-4.42,4.03-6.28,6.43c-2.31,2.98-3.73,6.1-4.27,9.36c-0.54,3.26-0.15,6.44,1.17,9.54c1.32,3.1,3.53,5.84,6.63,8.22 c4.7,3.61,9.5,5.08,14.38,4.4c4.88-0.68,9.16-3.4,12.84-8.16c1.21-1.56,2.22-3.04,3.04-4.44c0.82-1.4,1.62-3.07,2.42-5 l-10.39-7.98l-6.74,8.72l-5.68-4.37l11.96-15.49l20.23,15.54C137.98,138.43,134.96,144.41,130.6,150.05\"/> </g> <polygon style=\"f