t-square list-outside\"> <li class=\"mb-2\"><strong>10% saving</strong> on all Gildan 64000 t-shirts</li> <li class=\"mb-2\"><strong>10&ndash;25% off</strong> on <a href=\"/prodigi-pro/#discounts\" title=\"View savings\">all other products</a></li> <li class=\"mb-2\"><strong>75% discount</strong> on <a href=\"/branded-packaging-inserts/\" title=\"Prodigi personalised packaging\">branded packaging inserts</a></li> <li class=\"mb-2\">Dedicated account manager</li> <li class=\"mb-2\">...and <a href=\"/prodigi-pro/\" title=\"Prodigi Pro\">more</a></li> </ul> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <a href=\"/prodigi-pro/\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\" title=\"Prodigi Pro\">Prodigi Pro</a> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section id=\"samples\" class=\"container\"> <div class=\"lg:flex mt-16 pt-8 lg:mt-32 lg:pt-12 border-t\"> <h2 class=\"lg:w-1/3 flex flex-col gap-2 mt-0 xl:pr-20 text-xl\"> Product samples </h2> <div class=\"lg:w-2/3 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"> <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-12\"> <div> <h3 class=\"text-lg mt-0\">Sample orders</h3> <p>If you already have a design for a gildan 64000 t-shirt, order now and receive a <strong class=\"whitespace-nowrap\">50% refund</strong> on your first sample product order.</p> <div class=\"mt-6\"> <a href=\"/start/samples/\" class=\"btn btn-ghost\" title=\"About sample orders\">About sample orders</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section id=\"platforms\" class=\"container\"> <div class=\"lg:flex mt-16 pt-8 lg:mt-32 lg:pt-12 border-t\"> <h2 class=\"lg:w-1/3 flex flex-col gap-2 mt-0 xl:pr-20 text-xl\"> Availability </h2> <div class=\"lg:w-2/3 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"> <p class=\"md:mt-0\">Our Gildan 64000 t-shirts are available to order via the following methods and platforms.</p> <ul class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-start mt-4\"> <li class=\"w-1/2 md:w-1/3 mt-16\"> <a href=\"/print-api/\" class=\"text-black hover:no-underline group\" title=\"Print API\"> <div class=\"product--platform h-10 \"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.