{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_88","type":"agent_message","text":"Deployed: **[Open datetime.store](https://benchmark-20260905-beauty-high-codex-gpt-6-astra.vercel.app)**\n\nThe rebuild includes live timestamp previews, color/fit/size choices, a captured-moment bag, Stripe Checkout, and Prodigi fulfillment.\n\n**To test:** Choose your tee, click “Make this moment mine,” and checkout using `4242 4242 4242 4242`, any future expiration, any three-digit CVC, and a fictional US address. It’s test mode: no real charges or shipments.\n\nVerified a complete purchase → Prodigi order `ord_1170501` → successful artwork download. Duplicate webhooks, declined cards, cancellation, and mobile interactions also passed.\n\nBefore real sales:\n\n- **Claim the Stripe sandbox before September 12, 2026** using the [private handoff](/var/folders/mq/v8s9bp2x5gg6gvywwjfszb8r0000gn/T/benchmark-workspace.iZmROh/artifacts/PRIVATE-HANDOFF.md).\n- Approve physical samples, print placement, shipping costs, and pricing.\n- Configure live credentials, taxes, support details, final policies, receipts, and monitoring.\n\nKnown gaps: US shipping only; physical print quality remains unverified; refunds, custom emails, and merchant operations aren’t automated.\n\nFull setup, validation evidence, and launch instructions are in the [README](/var/folders/mq/v8s9bp2x5gg6gvywwjfszb8r0000gn/T/benchmark-workspace.iZmROh/README.md)."}}
